OL,3,GNEWSANew railway cafe approved for
OL,4,Ahistoric station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian railway station is in line
OL,7,Ffor a new cafe more than three years
OL,8,Fafter its tearoom closed.
OL,10,FDistrict planners have given permission
OL,11,Ffor Centenary Lounge to fit out the
OL,12,Fformer Lady Foley's Tearoom at Great
OL,13,FMalvern Station in Worcestershire.
OL,15,FThe tearoom closed in 2023 after 35
OL,16,Fyears at the site, with the owner
OL,17,Fsaying challenges for the business
OL,18,Fincluded the Covid pandemic and station
OL,19,Frestoration work.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
