OL,3,GNEWSANew railway cafe approved for
OL,4,Ahistoric station
OL,5,
OL,6,FCentenary Lounge, which runs cafes at
OL,7,Fseveral stations including Birmingham
OL,8,FMoor Street, said it would replace
OL,9,Fexisting counters, but refurbish and
OL,10,Fre-use tables and chairs as part of a
OL,11,Frevamp to bring it back into use.
